(text "Charge-only USB-C input. R1 and R2 pull CC1 and CC2 down to 5.1 k, which tells a USB-C\ncharger to supply 5 V. VBUS and GND go by wire to the VIN and GND pads of the joystick PCB,\nwhich carries the PTC fuse and the TVS diode. Do not connect this port and the XIAO's own\nUSB-C at the same time: both are the XIAO VBUS net.\nD1 lights while the cell charges: the firmware reads the charger's CHG pin and drives LED\nfrom a XIAO GPIO (D8) through J3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "28fcd33a-60ca-5700-ad7a-e9a58500ac67"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
(embedded_fonts no)
)
